# Senior Docker

- Multi-stage se houver build; runtime minimal (slim/distroless quando viavel)
- COPY requirements/lock antes do codigo; cache BuildKit (`--mount=type=cache`) em CI
- PID 1 com tini/dumb-init ou STOPSIGNAL SIGTERM explicito
- USER nao-root UID/GID fixos alinhados a Compose/K8s
- Healthcheck com interval/timeout/retries/start_period (paridade K8s)
- Sem tag `latest` em base de producao; Hadolint bloqueante
- Doc: `docs/engineering-senior-bar.md`; skill: `mcs-senior-cloud-ops`
